## Workspace Structure

INIT creates **only** the files below. Every other path appears when the first real file is written there — never as an empty folder.

```
{{PROJECT_NAME}}/
├── AGENTS.md
└── .omr/
    ├── tree-state.json
    ├── pattern.json
    └── locale.json
```

**Preferred language**: {{PREFERRED_LANGUAGE}} (source: {{LANGUAGE_SOURCE}}; timezone: {{TIMEZONE}})

Override anytime with `synth --language <tag>` (e.g. `en`, `zh-CN`, `ja`, `de`) or by editing `.omr/locale.json`. Policy: `references/LANGUAGE.md`.
### Created on first write (examples)

| When | Path created |
|------|----------------|
| Collect a paper | `materials/papers-raw/<ID>.<ext>` + `materials/papers/<ID>.md` (+ `docs/index/` when indexing) |
| Collect a web page | `materials/web/<file>` |
| Collect a GitHub URL | `materials/github/<file>` |
| Search log / HF / failure | `materials/search|datasets|failed/<file>` only if used |
| Idea note | `docs/ideas/<file>` |
| Analyze / decide | `docs/plans/<file>` |
| Synth drafts | `docs/<mode>/…` (outline, chapters, citation map, `_document.json`) |
| QA / gates | `.omr/quality-gates/<file>` |
| Version tag / backup | `.omr/versions/` or `.omr/backups/` |
| Exported deliverable | `deliverables/<topic>-<mode>-<language>.{docx,pdf,md}` |
| Wiki | `deliverables/wiki/` after Gate D if generated |

**Public vs private:** `deliverables/` is the only surface a reader or collaborator sees. Everything else (`materials/`, `docs/`, `.omr/`) is private working state — never hand it over, and never write final deliverables outside `deliverables/`.

## Ops (unified skill: oh-my-research)

- `collect <url|query>` — gather materials
- `analyze` — deep evidence + judgment (Gate A)
- `think [method]` — first principles / Socratic / triangulation / …
- `synth [--mode survey|report|…]` — deep research report (Gate D)
- `idea "…"` — speculative note
- `decide` — optional stance (Gate B)
- `reconcile` — contradiction repair / archive
- `version tag|history|backup|list`
- `workflow [--pattern Evidence-Deep]`

## Pattern

Default **Evidence-Deep**: collect → analyze ⟲ think → synth (survey/report).

## Gates

- Gate A / QA1 after analyze
- Gate D / QA2 / document lenses before publish
- Gate L when Loop active
- Gate B only if `decide` runs

## Evidence boundaries

Use `proven` / `suggests` / `inferred` correctly. Never upgrade weakly worded sources to proven.
